; lake_chasm.room - Abismo da Montanha (design 04 section 3.5): a flooded earth cleft 7 cells wide under a stone roof
; two rows above its lips, so no jump or double jump crosses it (the roof stops the arc, the water stops a dip).
; Enraizar from the east lip (col 15) roots it to the west lip (col 7) and the orchard tunnel; the climb from the lake side is single jumps.

[room]
origin = 0, 0
tileset = frozen_lake

